{
    "title": "Apartment List",
    "description": "Simplify your rental search with Apartment List.  Ready-to-move? We\u2019ll be your Rental Matchmaker \u2014 instantly connecting you with apartments you\u2019ll love. Download our app and spend 5 minutes with our Rental Matchmaker Quiz to save over 50 hours of apartment searching.\r\n\r\nHow? Our technology analyzes your preferences to match you with curated properties that fit your lifestyle. So you can say goodbye to endless lists and countless hours trying to find the perfect apartment and hello to a highly personalized and guided search experience.\r\n\r\nWith 6 million apartments in all 50 US states, we have the largest selection of premium apartments anywhere. You'll be sure to find your perfect apartment match!\r\n\r\n<h1><b>Apartment List Features</b></h1>\r\n<h2><b>Rental Matchmaker Quiz</b></h2>\r\n\u2022 Spend 5 minutes answering a few questions about your apartment preferences and lifestyle \u2014 from budget and neighborhood to desired amenities and pet policies. \r\n\u2022 Our technology does the rest \u2014 instantly curating a list of rentals that match your wishlist!\r\n\r\n<h2><b>Curated Apartment Matches</b></h2>\r\n\u2022 Swipe right or \u201cLove\u201d the apartments that have you swooning, and we\u2019ll add it to your shortlist. If you can\u2019t decide if it\u2019s a match, our \u201cMaybe\u201d button is always an option to save it for later.\r\n\u2022 Review apartments specifically categorized to your preferences. Swipe through \u201cPerfect Matches\u201d that match everything on your wishlist, or swipe through categories based on amenities, move-in dates, commute times, rent specials, lease lengths, and more!\r\n\u2022 Discover just-for-you \u201cSmart Matches\u201d based on local insights and like-minded searches. These may go beyond your initial preferences, but you\u2019ll find hidden gems you may have never thought to search for!\r\n\u2022 Head to your shortlist to review, compare, and contact your favorite properties 24/7, 365. \r\n\r\n<h2><b>24/7 Availability and Tour Booking</b></h2>\r\n\u2022 You up? So are we. Get in touch with your favorite properties anytime and anywhere via phone, text, or email.\r\n\u2022 Instantly get answers to your burning rental questions or book a tour directly from the app 24/7 365. \r\n\r\nReal-Time Alerts\r\n\u2022 Avoid rental FOMO with Real-Time Alerts! We'll track your matches in real-time and contact you with any unit availability updates, price changes, or new rent specials so you never miss out. \r\n\u2022 Be the first to know when apartments that match your shortlist become available!\r\n\r\n<h1><b>WHAT USERS ARE SAYING</b></h1>\r\n\u2022 \u201cIt\u2019s as if I exclaimed, \u201cI wish there was a way to magically filter through all the listings that don\u2019t meet my needs and be alerted only of ones that do,\u201d and boom, Apartment List shows up!\u201d\r\n\u2022 \u201cUnlike any other service out there, [this app] really takes into consideration all of your needs - amenities, distance to work, commute preferences, etc. - and makes apartment hunting a swipe-right-or-left game!\u201d\r\n\u2022 \u201cI was able to find apartments, book tours, track prices, and discounts, and eventually apply to my favorite! They notify you when prices go down or new special deals (like the 1-month free I got!). Thank you!\u201d\r\n\u2022 \u201cI found an apartment in one day, thanks to this app! An even better apartment than I was hoping for, and at a price I can afford!\u201d\r\n\r\nOur apartment listings feature high-quality photos, virtual tours, and real-time updates on pricing, unit availability, and rent specials. We know it all comes down to the details, so we don\u2019t skip out on the fine print \u2014 like pet policies and move-in fees!\r\n\r\nDownload Apartment List and find your perfect apartment match today! We\u2019re always looking to improve your rental experience, so be sure to check back for awesome new features.\r\n\r\nDon\u2019t hesitate to share your feedback with us by emailing feedback@apartmentlist.com. We\u2019d love to hear from you!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Simplify your rental search with Apartment List.  Ready-to-move? We\u2019ll be your Rental Matchmaker \u2014 instantly connecting you with apartments you\u2019ll love. Download our app and spend 5 minutes with our Rental Matchmaker Quiz to save over 50 hours of apartment searching.<br><br>How? Our technology analyzes your preferences to match you with curated properties that fit your lifestyle. So you can say goodbye to endless lists and countless hours trying to find the perfect apartment and hello to a highly personalized and guided search experience.<br><br>With 6 million apartments in all 50 US states, we have the largest selection of premium apartments anywhere. You&#39;ll be sure to find your perfect apartment match!<br><br><h1><b>Apartment List Features</b></h1><br><h2><b>Rental Matchmaker Quiz</b></h2><br>\u2022 Spend 5 minutes answering a few questions about your apartment preferences and lifestyle \u2014 from budget and neighborhood to desired amenities and pet policies. <br>\u2022 Our technology does the rest \u2014 instantly curating a list of rentals that match your wishlist!<br><br><h2><b>Curated Apartment Matches</b></h2><br>\u2022 Swipe right or \u201cLove\u201d the apartments that have you swooning, and we\u2019ll add it to your shortlist. If you can\u2019t decide if it\u2019s a match, our \u201cMaybe\u201d button is always an option to save it for later.<br>\u2022 Review apartments specifically categorized to your preferences. Swipe through \u201cPerfect Matches\u201d that match everything on your wishlist, or swipe through categories based on amenities, move-in dates, commute times, rent specials, lease lengths, and more!<br>\u2022 Discover just-for-you \u201cSmart Matches\u201d based on local insights and like-minded searches. These may go beyond your initial preferences, but you\u2019ll find hidden gems you may have never thought to search for!<br>\u2022 Head to your shortlist to review, compare, and contact your favorite properties 24/7, 365. <br><br><h2><b>24/7 Availability and Tour Booking</b></h2><br>\u2022 You up? So are we. Get in touch with your favorite properties anytime and anywhere via phone, text, or email.<br>\u2022 Instantly get answers to your burning rental questions or book a tour directly from the app 24/7 365. <br><br>Real-Time Alerts<br>\u2022 Avoid rental FOMO with Real-Time Alerts! We&#39;ll track your matches in real-time and contact you with any unit availability updates, price changes, or new rent specials so you never miss out. <br>\u2022 Be the first to know when apartments that match your shortlist become available!<br><br><h1><b>WHAT USERS ARE SAYING</b></h1><br>\u2022 \u201cIt\u2019s as if I exclaimed, \u201cI wish there was a way to magically filter through all the listings that don\u2019t meet my needs and be alerted only of ones that do,\u201d and boom, Apartment List shows up!\u201d<br>\u2022 \u201cUnlike any other service out there, [this app] really takes into consideration all of your needs - amenities, distance to work, commute preferences, etc. - and makes apartment hunting a swipe-right-or-left game!\u201d<br>\u2022 \u201cI was able to find apartments, book tours, track prices, and discounts, and eventually apply to my favorite! They notify you when prices go down or new special deals (like the 1-month free I got!). Thank you!\u201d<br>\u2022 \u201cI found an apartment in one day, thanks to this app! An even better apartment than I was hoping for, and at a price I can afford!\u201d<br><br>Our apartment listings feature high-quality photos, virtual tours, and real-time updates on pricing, unit availability, and rent specials. We know it all comes down to the details, so we don\u2019t skip out on the fine print \u2014 like pet policies and move-in fees!<br><br>Download Apartment List and find your perfect apartment match today! We\u2019re always looking to improve your rental experience, so be sure to check back for awesome new features.<br><br>Don\u2019t hesitate to share your feedback with us by emailing feedback@apartmentlist.com. We\u2019d love to hear from you!",
